      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "mental",
        "primal"
      ],
      "text": "Creatures other than animals, gremlins, and kholo within 20 feet become extremely unlucky. They must attempt a DC 16 Will save save, rolling this Will save twice and using the worse result.\n\nOn a successful save, the creature can't be affected by pugwampi unluck auras for 24 hours. On a failure, the creature must roll twice and use the worse result on all checks as long as it's within 20 feet of the pugwampi.\n\nMultiple pugwampis don't create any increased effect.",
